### List machines
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vending-machines

### Start session on AIRPORT_T1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vending-machines/AIRPORT_T1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slotId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Add payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vending-machines/AIRPORT_T1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "COIN",
  "amount": 3.00,
  "denomination": "3.00"
}

### Dispense
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vending-machines/AIRPORT_T1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/dispense

### Refund (alternative to dispense)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vending-machines/AIRPORT_T1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/refund
